cff-version: 1.2.0
title: hermetic-dmsa
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Hermetic AI Contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Hermetic-AI/hermetic-dmsa
url: https://hermetic-ai.github.io/hermetic-dmsa/
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0.dev0
abstract: >-
  A provenance-aware memory layer for coding agents. Stores raw engineering
  history with full provenance, retrieves applicable evidence through exact,
  sparse, and optional dense channels fused with RRF, and evolves its own
  retrieval policy offline behind a paired-replay regression gate.
keywords:
  - llm-agent
  - agent-memory
  - retrieval
  - provenance
  - self-improvement
  - model-context-protocol
  - software-engineering
